en/tip/28-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Don’t buy weight‑loss pills, coffee, candies, or “enzymatic plums” (plums claimed to be soaked in enzymes) that promise rapid results"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/28-05","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Do not use anabolic steroids (“muscle‑building injections” or “oral pills”) to build muscle"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/28-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"If you need weight-loss medication, get a prescription from a doctor — don’t buy it from online shops that ship it without one"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/28-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Sex hormone therapy should only be used when prescribed by a doctor and with regular follow‑up; do not buy it online and do not adjust the dose on your own"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/28-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"If the feeling of “being unattractive” has reached the point where you constantly check your reflection and obsess over changes, get a body image assessment before considering surgery"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/28-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"For orthodontic treatment, see a qualified orthodontic doctor in person and attend follow-ups; do not buy aligners online and wear them yourself at home"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/28"},"children":["Chapter 28"," ·"," ","Don’t harm your body just to change its appearance"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"28-05"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["05"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Do not use anabolic steroids (“muscle‑building injections” or “oral pills”) to build muscle"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["A Danish study followed 545 men who tested positive for anabolic steroids and compared them with 5,450 age‑matched controls. Users had a three‑fold higher risk of death, and the median number of hospital visits per year was 0.81 versus 0.36 for controls. More than 10 % of steroid users developed acne, gynecomastia, or erectile dysfunction. In China these drugs are prescription‑only, and any source selling them illegally is breaking the law."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no cost involved;"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Danish researchers matched each steroid user with a control of the same age. The original cohort comprised…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Do not use anabolic steroids (“muscle‑building injections” or “oral pills”) to build muscle"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no cost involved; you even save money on medication. The hard part is accepting that muscle growth will be slow."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Danish researchers matched each steroid user with a control of the same age. The original cohort comprised 545 men whose androgenic steroid tests were positive between 2006‑01‑03 and 2018‑03‑01; they were paired with 5,450 controls. An additional validation used 644 refusers and 6,440 controls. Results showed a three‑fold increase in mortality among users (HR = 3.0; 95 % CI 1.3–7.0). The median yearly number of hospital visits was 0.81 versus 0.36 (P < 0.0001). Median means that half of the users had more visits and half fewer; such a low P‑value indicates this difference is highly unlikely to be random. Acne, gynecomastia, and erectile dysfunction each affected over 10 % of users – at least one in ten – a rate far above that of controls (P < 0.0001). The validation cohort yielded the same findings. Article 7 of China’s Anti‑Doping Regulations states that all substances on the prohibited list are strictly controlled; no entity may produce, sell, import, or export them illegally. The same regulation designates anabolic agents and peptide hormones as prescription drugs, meaning they may be obtained only with a doctor’s prescription; “anabolic agents” is the official term used in legislation."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Horwitz H et al. (2019). Health consequences of androgenic anabolic steroid use. J Intern Med. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/joim.12850","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/joim.12850"]},"；国务院 (2004). 反兴奋剂条例（国务院令第 398 号，第七条、第九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2004/content_63129.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2004/content_63129.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/joim.12850","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["This is an observational study, not a randomized trial; steroid users may also engage in other risky behaviors, so the three‑fold risk increase may not be attributable solely to the drugs. The true effect size likely falls between 1.3 and 7.0. However, visible side effects such as acne, gynecomastia, and erectile dysfunction are less prone to bias. Legally these products are termed “anabolic agents”; any product described with that phrase contains them. Ordinary protein powder or creatine does not fall under this category. A problem is that some products marketed as “muscle‑building powders” or “nutritional supplements” may contain hidden steroids while claiming rapid results. The screening method is the same as for weight‑loss products (see item 4: avoid any weight‑loss drug promising quick results). Legitimate drugs are prescription‑only and carry verifiable approval numbers; any product sold as a “muscle‑building supplement” that promises results within weeks is probably adulterated."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/28-04"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"t